<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Adrenaline rush greatly increases the speed of the hybrid for a while, and then it needs to be recharged to be used again.-->
  <GR_AdrenalineBurst.description>使肾上腺超负荷运转，大幅提升自身的移动速度。效果结束后会陷入长达半天的力竭状态。</GR_AdrenalineBurst.description>
  <!--EN: adrenaline rush-->
  <GR_AdrenalineBurst.label>肾上腺素激发</GR_AdrenalineBurst.label>
  <!--EN: exhausted-->
  <GR_AdrenalineBurst.stages.1.label>筋疲力尽的</GR_AdrenalineBurst.stages.1.label>
  <!--EN: A condition that makes an animal unable to walk by interfering with the motor cortex. If not treated in time, Abasia inevitably interferes with functioning of organs - for example by halting the heart functions. A creature with Animal Abasia can be tended to which will slow down the disease, but cannot be cured.\n\nAny hybrid or paragon animal will get this disease 3 years after being hatched or born naturally, though this is affected by the hybrids's quality.-->
  <GR_AnimalAbasia.description>因大脑皮层运动区遭到扰乱而失去了行动能力。如果患病的生物得不到及时的治疗，步瘫症很可能会使心脏也停止跳动。\n\n这种疾病无法根治，定期护理只能延缓症状的恶化。\n\n所有混种生物和无瑕生物都有可能会在出生3年后患上这种基因疾病。根据混种生物和无瑕生物的品质不同，其发病时间也会推迟或提前。</GR_AnimalAbasia.description>
  <!--EN: animal abasia-->
  <GR_AnimalAbasia.label>步瘫症</GR_AnimalAbasia.label>
  <!--EN: paralyzed-->
  <GR_AnimalAbasia.stages.0.label>瘫痪</GR_AnimalAbasia.stages.0.label>
  <!--EN: This creature was genetically modified with a controller booster.-->
  <GR_AnimalControlHediff.description>此单位体内植入了神经操控器，可以直接被征召。</GR_AnimalControlHediff.description>
  <!--EN: animal controller-->
  <GR_AnimalControlHediff.label>神经操控</GR_AnimalControlHediff.label>
  <!--EN: A disease originating from a bacterial infection that attacks lungs. Animals with tuberculosis will keep spitting blood until blood loss causes them to die. Every time a coughing attack occurs, the lungs of that animal will get more and more damaged. A creature with Animal Tuberculosis can be tended to which will slow down the disease, but cannot be cured.\n\nAny hybrid or paragon animal will get this disease 3 years after being hatched or born naturally, though this is affected by the hybrids's quality.-->
  <GR_AnimalTuberculosis.description>因肺部被细菌感染而引发的疾病。如果患病的生物得不到及时的治疗，肺结核会使其不断地咳血，因此持续受损的肺部最终也会完全坏死。\n\n这种疾病无法根治，定期护理只能延缓症状的恶化。\n\n所有混种生物和无瑕生物都有可能会在出生3年后患上这种基因疾病。根据混种生物和无瑕生物的品质不同，其发病时间也会推迟或提前。</GR_AnimalTuberculosis.description>
  <!--EN: animal tuberculosis-->
  <GR_AnimalTuberculosis.label>肺结核</GR_AnimalTuberculosis.label>
  <!--EN: initial-->
  <GR_AnimalTuberculosis.stages.0.label>肺部受损</GR_AnimalTuberculosis.stages.0.label>
  <!--EN: damaged lungs-->
  <GR_AnimalTuberculosis.stages.1.label>轻微</GR_AnimalTuberculosis.stages.1.label>
  <!--EN: very damaged lungs-->
  <GR_AnimalTuberculosis.stages.2.label>肺部严重受损</GR_AnimalTuberculosis.stages.2.label>
  <!--EN: bear claws-->
  <GR_BearClaws.comps.0.tools.0.label>熊爪</GR_BearClaws.comps.0.tools.0.label>
  <!--EN: An improvement over the bionic Power Claw, these claws have been vat-grown with a mixture of human and bear DNA, and replace the subject's hand with versatile, non-retractable claws.-->
  <GR_BearClaws.description>一个已安装的蛮熊爪。</GR_BearClaws.description>
  <!--EN: humanoid implant: bear claws-->
  <GR_BearClaws.label>蛮熊爪</GR_BearClaws.label>
  <!--EN: animal Implant: bear leg-->
  <GR_BearLeg.comps.0.tools.0.label>动物植入物：熊腿</GR_BearLeg.comps.0.tools.0.label>
  <!--EN: A prosthetic animal leg strengthened with bear muscles, and ending in a powerful bear claw that adds a powerful melee attack.-->
  <GR_BearLeg.description>一个已安装的蛮熊肢。</GR_BearLeg.description>
  <!--EN: animal Implant: bear leg-->
  <GR_BearLeg.label>蛮熊肢</GR_BearLeg.label>
  <!--EN: An implant that uses bear genes to improve function of the liver. Specially useful for those alcoholic chickens.-->
  <GR_BearLiver.description>一个已安装的蛮熊肝。</GR_BearLiver.description>
  <!--EN: animal Implant: bear liver-->
  <GR_BearLiver.label>蛮熊肝</GR_BearLiver.label>
  <!--EN: Grafts of bear muscle tissue on the subject's torso increase overall strength and stamina. These grafts however tend to stimulate the production of an abundance of body hair.-->
  <GR_BearMuscleTissue.description>一个已安装的蛮熊肌肉组织。</GR_BearMuscleTissue.description>
  <!--EN: humanoid implant: bear muscle tissue-->
  <GR_BearMuscleTissue.label>蛮熊肌肉组织</GR_BearMuscleTissue.label>
  <!--EN: This creature has been victim of a frenzied attack.-->
  <GR_BloodFrenzy.description>此单位已被拥有“嗜血狂猎”能力的生物攻击了。</GR_BloodFrenzy.description>
  <!--EN: victim of blood frenzy-->
  <GR_BloodFrenzy.label>嗜血狂猎</GR_BloodFrenzy.label>
  <!--EN: An implant that uses chemfuel to pump blood through the animal's body. This implant is intended for creatures whose heart is failing catastrophically, since it is less efficient than a natural heart.-->
  <GR_BoomalopeHeart.description>一个已安装的爆炸羊心脏。</GR_BoomalopeHeart.description>
  <!--EN: animal Implant: boomalope heart-->
  <GR_BoomalopeHeart.label>爆炸羊心脏</GR_BoomalopeHeart.label>
  <!--EN: These skin nodules can be integrated in a human's torso, causing a huge explosion if the subjects dies violently.-->
  <GR_BoomalopeNodules.description>一个已安装的爆炸囊。</GR_BoomalopeNodules.description>
  <!--EN: humanoid implant: boomalope nodules-->
  <GR_BoomalopeNodules.label>爆炸囊</GR_BoomalopeNodules.label>
  <!--EN: An implant that uses boomalope genes to improve function of the stomach.-->
  <GR_BoomalopeStomach.description>一个已安装的爆炸羊胃。</GR_BoomalopeStomach.description>
  <!--EN: animal Implant: boomalope stomach-->
  <GR_BoomalopeStomach.label>爆炸羊胃</GR_BoomalopeStomach.label>
  <!--EN: This huge leporid ear gives amazing enhanced hearing. Also, super kawaii!-->
  <GR_BunnyEars.description>一个已安装的兔耳。</GR_BunnyEars.description>
  <!--EN: humanoid implant: bunny ear-->
  <GR_BunnyEars.label>兔耳</GR_BunnyEars.label>
  <!--EN: Burrows underground to be able to move while being almost impervious to attacks. This ability needs to be recharged to be used again.-->
  <GR_Burrowing.description>挖洞潜入地下，极大幅提升自身的防御力。</GR_Burrowing.description>
  <!--EN: burrowing underground-->
  <GR_Burrowing.label>潜入地下</GR_Burrowing.label>
  <!--EN: recovering-->
  <GR_Burrowing.stages.1.label>恢复中</GR_Burrowing.stages.1.label>
  <!--EN: An eye implant that uses genetic splicing with canid genes to give an old (or damaged) eye decent vision. This implant is not meant to replace healthy eyes.-->
  <GR_CanidEye.description>一个已安装的犬狼眼。</GR_CanidEye.description>
  <!--EN: animal Implant: canid eye-->
  <GR_CanidEye.label>犬狼眼</GR_CanidEye.label>
  <!--EN: This hybrid humanoid / feline eye provides improved night vision, at the expense of a certain short-sightedness outside and during the day. Ideal for nyctophile colonists.-->
  <GR_CatEye.description>一个已安装的猫咪眼。</GR_CatEye.description>
  <!--EN: humanoid implant: cat eye-->
  <GR_CatEye.label>猫咪眼</GR_CatEye.label>
  <!--EN: Cat reflexes greatly increases the speed and melee dodge chance of the hybrid for a while, and then it needs to be recharged to be used again.-->
  <GR_CatReflexes.description>激发猫科生物的本能，提升自身的移动速度与近战闪避几率。</GR_CatReflexes.description>
  <!--EN: cat reflexes-->
  <GR_CatReflexes.label>猫之本能</GR_CatReflexes.label>
  <!--EN: exhausted-->
  <GR_CatReflexes.stages.1.label>筋疲力尽的</GR_CatReflexes.stages.1.label>
  <!--EN: A tail implant that uses genetic splicing with feline genes to substitute a broken or missing tail. This implant is not meant to replace a healthy tail.-->
  <GR_CatTail.description>一个已安装的猫咪尾。</GR_CatTail.description>
  <!--EN: animal Implant: cat tail-->
  <GR_CatTail.label>猫咪尾</GR_CatTail.label>
  <!--EN: Releases an insanity cloud that reduces sanity of anyone passing through it, and then it needs to be recharged to be used again.-->
  <GR_CausedHorror.description>向四周散布大量能使生物逐渐丧失理智的迷雾。</GR_CausedHorror.description>
  <!--EN: recently invoked the insanity of That Which Man Is Not Meant to Know-->
  <GR_CausedHorror.label>释放疯狂迷雾</GR_CausedHorror.label>
  <!--EN: recovering-->
  <GR_CausedHorror.stages.0.label>正在恢复</GR_CausedHorror.stages.0.label>
  <!--EN: Releases a poison cloud that harms anyone passing through it, except reptilians, and then it needs to be recharged to be used again.-->
  <GR_CausedPoisonCloud.description>向四周散布大量能使生物中毒的毒气。</GR_CausedPoisonCloud.description>
  <!--EN: recently released poison cloud-->
  <GR_CausedPoisonCloud.label>释放毒气</GR_CausedPoisonCloud.label>
  <!--EN: recovering-->
  <GR_CausedPoisonCloud.stages.0.label>正在恢复</GR_CausedPoisonCloud.stages.0.label>
  <!--EN: A reinforced bionic heart that acts like a miniature 4-stroke internal combustion engine powered by chemfuel to pump blood through the body.-->
  <GR_ChemfuelHeart.description>一个已安装的化合燃料心脏。</GR_ChemfuelHeart.description>
  <!--EN: humanoid implant: chemfuel heart-->
  <GR_ChemfuelHeart.label>化合燃料心脏</GR_ChemfuelHeart.label>
  <!--EN: A reinforced bionic stomach that uses a combination of gastric acid and chemfuel to efficiently digest food.-->
  <GR_ChemfuelStomach.description>一个已安装的化合燃料胃。</GR_ChemfuelStomach.description>
  <!--EN: humanoid implant: chemfuel stomach-->
  <GR_ChemfuelStomach.label>化合燃料胃</GR_ChemfuelStomach.label>
  <!--EN: An implant that uses chicken brain tissue to patch damaged neurological pathways. This implant is intended for brain-dead creatures.-->
  <GR_ChickenBrains.description>一个已安装的家禽脑。</GR_ChickenBrains.description>
  <!--EN: animal Implant: chicken brains-->
  <GR_ChickenBrains.label>家禽脑</GR_ChickenBrains.label>
  <!--EN: An implant that uses chicken genes to improve function of the kidney. Birds have large kidneys. Yep, you learned that today.-->
  <GR_ChickenKidney.description>一个已安装的飞禽肾。</GR_ChickenKidney.description>
  <!--EN: animal Implant: chicken kidney-->
  <GR_ChickenKidney.label>飞禽肾</GR_ChickenKidney.label>
  <!--EN: A bionic heart implant using a reinforced shell of insectoid chitin for protection. This is a heart designed to take a beating. Pun intended, but it's the last one, I promise.-->
  <GR_ChitinousHeart.description>一个已安装的甲壳质心脏。</GR_ChitinousHeart.description>
  <!--EN: animal Implant: chitinous heart-->
  <GR_ChitinousHeart.label>甲壳质心脏</GR_ChitinousHeart.label>
  <!--EN: This hybrid humanoid / insectoid eye provides improved vision in a wide range of different wavelengths, including those usually outside the human range, completely modifying the way the subject perceives his surroundings.-->
  <GR_CompoundEye.description>一个已安装的虫族复眼（人类）。</GR_CompoundEye.description>
  <!--EN: humanoid implant: compound insectoid eye-->
  <GR_CompoundEye.label>虫族复眼</GR_CompoundEye.label>
  <!--EN: A bionic implant adding a sturdy crocodile spine to the creature's skeletal system.-->
  <GR_CrocodileSpine.description>一个已安装的鳄鱼脊椎。</GR_CrocodileSpine.description>
  <!--EN: animal Implant: crocodile spine-->
  <GR_CrocodileSpine.label>鳄鱼脊椎</GR_CrocodileSpine.label>
  <!--EN: A set of improved teeth designed to rapidly chew and ingest any kind of food. Leaves kind of a mess, though...-->
  <GR_DevouringJaws.description>一个已安装的犬狼颌。</GR_DevouringJaws.description>
  <!--EN: humanoid implant: devouring jaws-->
  <GR_DevouringJaws.label>犬狼颌</GR_DevouringJaws.label>
  <!--EN: mole claws-->
  <GR_DiggingBearClaws.comps.0.tools.0.label>鼹鼠爪</GR_DiggingBearClaws.comps.0.tools.0.label>
  <!--EN: Grotesque but powerful hand blades that have been modified to be used in mining operations, increasing both speed and yield.-->
  <GR_DiggingBearClaws.description>一个已安装的鼹鼠爪。</GR_DiggingBearClaws.description>
  <!--EN: humanoid implant: digging mole claws-->
  <GR_DiggingBearClaws.label>鼹鼠爪</GR_DiggingBearClaws.label>
  <!--EN: tended-->
  <GR_DistortionHediff.comps.0.labelSolidTendedWell>照顾</GR_DistortionHediff.comps.0.labelSolidTendedWell>
  <!--EN: bandaged-->
  <GR_DistortionHediff.comps.0.labelTendedWell>缠着绷带的</GR_DistortionHediff.comps.0.labelTendedWell>
  <!--EN: tended-->
  <GR_DistortionHediff.comps.0.labelTendedWellInner>照顾</GR_DistortionHediff.comps.0.labelTendedWellInner>
  <!--EN: warped scar-->
  <GR_DistortionHediff.comps.2.permanentLabel>扭曲的疤痕</GR_DistortionHediff.comps.2.permanentLabel>
  <!--EN: This body part has been terribly warped by being exposed to a dangerous spatial distortion. Warping is very painful, and warped body parts are often lost.-->
  <GR_DistortionHediff.description>空间扭曲弹造成的扭曲伤口。</GR_DistortionHediff.description>
  <!--EN: Lost to warping-->
  <GR_DistortionHediff.injuryProps.destroyedLabel>被粉碎</GR_DistortionHediff.injuryProps.destroyedLabel>
  <!--EN: warping-->
  <GR_DistortionHediff.label>扭曲伤</GR_DistortionHediff.label>
  <!--EN: A chemical addiction to active mechanites. Long-term presence of active mechanites has caused neurological adaptations at the cellular level, so the brain can no longer function properly without them.
\nWithout regular doses of active mechanites, withdrawal symptoms will begin. However, extended abstinence will force the brain to adapt back to its normal state, resolving the addiction.-->
  <GR_ElectroEggAddiction.description>长期过量的摄取活化型纳米机械已经造成了神经系统的适应。\n\n如果没有定期摄取合适数量的机械蛋，戒断反应就会开始。长时间的戒断会迫使大脑适应并恢复到正常状态，从而戒除活化型纳米机械成瘾。</GR_ElectroEggAddiction.description>
  <!--EN: active mechanites addiction-->
  <GR_ElectroEggAddiction.label>活化型纳米机械成瘾</GR_ElectroEggAddiction.label>
  <!--EN: withdrawal-->
  <GR_ElectroEggAddiction.stages.1.label>提款</GR_ElectroEggAddiction.stages.1.label>
  <!--EN: Active mechanites in the bloodstream. They lift the mood and increase attentiveness.-->
  <GR_ElectroEggHigh.description>流淌在血液里的活化型纳米机械。它能够增强意识与新陈代谢，并提供心情增益。</GR_ElectroEggHigh.description>
  <!--EN: high on active mechanites-->
  <GR_ElectroEggHigh.label>活化型纳米机械亢奋</GR_ElectroEggHigh.label>
  <!--EN: an active mechanites high-->
  <GR_ElectroEggHigh.labelNoun>活化型纳米机械亢奋</GR_ElectroEggHigh.labelNoun>
  <!--EN: A built-up tolerance to active mechanites. The more severe this tolerance is, the more active mechanites it takes to get the same effect.-->
  <GR_ElectroEggTolerance.description>对活化型纳米机械的长期耐受性。耐受性越严重，想达到和之前同样的效果所需要的机械蛋也就越多。</GR_ElectroEggTolerance.description>
  <!--EN: active mechanites tolerance-->
  <GR_ElectroEggTolerance.label>活化型纳米机械耐受</GR_ElectroEggTolerance.label>
  <!--EN: The brain or neural center of this creature has been extracted and refined into genetic material.-->
  <GR_ExtractedBrain.description>此单位的大脑已被基因抽取器转化成了基因物质。</GR_ExtractedBrain.description>
  <!--EN: brain extracted-->
  <GR_ExtractedBrain.label>大脑被抽取</GR_ExtractedBrain.label>
  <!--EN: A chemical addiction to featherdust. Long-term use of featherdust has caused neurological adaptations at the cellular level, so the brain can no longer function properly without the drug.
\nWithout regular doses of featherdust, withdrawal symptoms will begin. However, extended abstinence will force the brain to adapt back to its normal state, resolving the addiction.-->
  <GR_FeatherdustAddiction.description>长期过量的摄取羽尘已经造成了神经系统的适应。\n\n如果没有定期摄取合适剂量的羽尘烟，戒断反应就会开始。长时间的戒断会迫使大脑适应并恢复到正常状态，从而戒除羽尘成瘾。</GR_FeatherdustAddiction.description>
  <!--EN: featherdust dependence-->
  <GR_FeatherdustAddiction.label>羽尘成瘾</GR_FeatherdustAddiction.label>
  <!--EN: withdrawal-->
  <GR_FeatherdustAddiction.stages.1.label>提款</GR_FeatherdustAddiction.stages.1.label>
  <!--EN: Featherdust's active chemical in the bloodstream. Generates a soft feeling of fuzzy well-being.-->
  <GR_FeatherdustHigh.description>流淌在血液里的羽尘化合物能产生一种柔软的幸福感。</GR_FeatherdustHigh.description>
  <!--EN: stoned on featherdust-->
  <GR_FeatherdustHigh.label>羽尘沉醉</GR_FeatherdustHigh.label>
  <!--EN: A built-up tolerance to featherdust. The more severe this tolerance is, the more featherdust it takes to get the same effect.-->
  <GR_FeatherdustTolerance.description>对羽尘的长期耐受性。耐受性越严重，想达到和之前同样的效果所需要的羽尘烟也就越多。</GR_FeatherdustTolerance.description>
  <!--EN: featherdust tolerance-->
  <GR_FeatherdustTolerance.label>羽尘耐受</GR_FeatherdustTolerance.label>
  <!--EN: The smell of its enemies' blood has filled this hybrid with a frenzy.-->
  <GR_Frenzied.description>此单位正因敌人鲜血的气味而变得愈发狂暴。</GR_Frenzied.description>
  <!--EN: frenzied-->
  <GR_Frenzied.label>嗜血狂暴</GR_Frenzied.label>
  <!--EN: A disease which causes affected creatures to enter berserk rages. A creature with greater scaria can't be cured and kills its host about five days after infection. Their seething rage will allow them to survive without having to eat or rest until their inevitable death.-->
  <GR_GreaterScaria.description>这种疾病会使受感染的生物进入狂暴状态。与普通的狂暴症不同，患上这种狂暴症的生物会在五天后立即死亡。\n\n所有混种生物和无瑕生物都有可能会在出生3年后患上这种基因疾病。根据混种生物和无瑕生物的品质不同，其发病时间也会推迟或提前。</GR_GreaterScaria.description>
  <!--EN: greater scaria-->
  <GR_GreaterScaria.label>致死型狂暴症</GR_GreaterScaria.label>
  <!--EN: Genetically altered hairballs are suffocating this creature. This negatively affects breathing and can even cause unconsciousness.-->
  <GR_HairballDamage.description>被基因工程改造过的毛团包裹了脸部。此单位的呼吸能力会逐渐降低，严重时还会呕吐或昏迷。</GR_HairballDamage.description>
  <!--EN: suffocating damage-->
  <GR_HairballDamage.label>窒息</GR_HairballDamage.label>
  <!--EN: initial-hidden-->
  <GR_HairballDamage.stages.0.label>较轻</GR_HairballDamage.stages.0.label>
  <!--EN: initial-->
  <GR_HairballDamage.stages.1.label>中等</GR_HairballDamage.stages.1.label>
  <!--EN: minor-->
  <GR_HairballDamage.stages.2.label>极重</GR_HairballDamage.stages.2.label>
  <!--EN: moderate-->
  <GR_HairballDamage.stages.3.label>轻微</GR_HairballDamage.stages.3.label>
  <!--EN: serious-->
  <GR_HairballDamage.stages.4.label>轻微</GR_HairballDamage.stages.4.label>
  <!--EN: extreme-->
  <GR_HairballDamage.stages.5.label>恶心</GR_HairballDamage.stages.5.label>
  <!--EN: nauseating-->
  <GR_HairballDamage.stages.6.label>nauseating</GR_HairballDamage.stages.6.label>
  <!--EN: A biochip that modifies the brain to reduce the need for sleep.-->
  <GR_HibernationModule.description>一个已安装的冬眠模块芯片。</GR_HibernationModule.description>
  <!--EN: humanoid implant: hibernation module-->
  <GR_HibernationModule.label>冬眠模块芯片</GR_HibernationModule.label>
  <!--EN: This creature will die quickly if set on fire.-->
  <GR_HighlyFlammable.description>此单位极易受到火焰伤害。</GR_HighlyFlammable.description>
  <!--EN: highly flammable-->
  <GR_HighlyFlammable.label>高度易燃</GR_HighlyFlammable.label>
  <!--EN: thrumbo horn-->
  <GR_HumanThrumboHorn.comps.0.tools.0.label>敲击号角</GR_HumanThrumboHorn.comps.0.tools.0.label>
  <!--EN: A genetically modified thrumbo horn that can be implanted in a subject's forehead. Nasty.-->
  <GR_HumanThrumboHorn.description>一个已安装的秘兽角。</GR_HumanThrumboHorn.description>
  <!--EN: humanoid implant: thrumbo horn-->
  <GR_HumanThrumboHorn.label>秘兽角</GR_HumanThrumboHorn.label>
  <!--EN: This is a hidden hediff that modifies the hybrid's hunger depending on quality.-->
  <GR_HungerByQuality.description>混种生物饥饿度受品质影响的机制是依靠这条隐藏的健康状态来发挥作用的。</GR_HungerByQuality.description>
  <!--EN: quality-->
  <GR_HungerByQuality.label>品质影响</GR_HungerByQuality.label>
  <!--EN: A synthetic skin substitute that is much thicker and a much better insulator than human skin. This provides a measure of defense but, more importantly, makes the subject more resistant to high temperatures.-->
  <GR_IguanaScales.description>一个已安装的鬣蜥鳞肤。</GR_IguanaScales.description>
  <!--EN: humanoid implant: iguana scales-->
  <GR_IguanaScales.label>鬣蜥鳞肤</GR_IguanaScales.label>
